error[invalid-annotation-target]: @key can only be applied to struct fields
    ┌ test.idl:11:6
    │
  9 │ union Outer switch(long) {
 10 │ case 1:
 11 │     @key Inner inner;
    ·      ^^^ invalid annotation target
 12 │ };
    └──

error[union-key]: union discriminator for 'Inner' cannot be @optional
   ┌ test.idl:2:21
   │
 2 │ union Inner switch(@optional boolean) {
   ·                     ^^^^^^^^ @optional not allowed on discriminator
 3 │ case TRUE:
 4 │     string value;
   └──
 help: remove @optional from the discriminator
 note: union discriminators must always be present

error[union-key]: union variant 'inner' cannot use @key
    ┌ test.idl:11:6
    │
  9 │ union Outer switch(long) {
 10 │ case 1:
 11 │     @key Inner inner;
    ·      ^^^ @key not allowed on union variant
 12 │ };
    └──
 help: remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
 note: only the union discriminator can be marked as @key
